% Scenario: a user path's outline. The first form of ustrokepath is
% newpath uappend strokepath (PLRM3 §8.2 ustrokepath): page 1 fills
% the outline it leaves, page 2 fills the outline strokepath leaves of
% the same path built by hand, and the two dump the same.
30 setlinewidth 1 setlinecap
{0 0 500 500 setbbox 120 150 moveto 360 220 lineto 220 500 lineto} ustrokepath fill
showpage
30 setlinewidth 1 setlinecap
120 150 moveto 360 220 lineto 220 500 lineto strokepath fill
showpage
